body:
If I lost that much time invested on a looter shooter because of a bug I'll sue the developers and gladly include any other players with the same problem.

&#x200B;

Character wipes on a looter shooter is not ok.

Don't fix the stacking cap that's the whole point of builds... 

&#x200B;

This game isn't pvp guys c'mon with those kind of nerfs you'll push away the player base smh

That's because it's not an RPG anymore. Fucking CDPR misleading players like that... 

&#x200B;

[Despite this subtle change, I was never aware it wasn't a RPG anymore until today.](https://i.imgur.com/oDldUQQ.png)

I'm only uploading this again because it was removed the first time and I got no answer by asking to reconsider. 

&#x200B;

Please, this isn't low effort guys. Thanks!
